{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous planet that's different every time and try to survive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Union's job for you is clear: research the alien wildlife -- for science! However, in this case, researching may include lasers, explosions, hungry aliens, space sushi, and other similarly delicious-or-terrifying hazards. In-between missions, use scrap metal you've collected to upgrade your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the amazing miracle of Science, you too can discover more than 200 incredible lost technologies such as the Bucket or the Action Figure. Collect them all to stock your space station with piles of toys, weapons, and creatures, like the hoarder you've always wanted to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/305640/extras/63740096f8da8445e0689fe38d72fe6d.avif?t=1764602480\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alien Frenemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look, we all love aliens. But they don't always love us back. That's why we invented DOMESTICATION. The era of pet aliens has been one of many slimy, tentacled tummy-rubs... but next, we discovered a new problem: sometimes our pets wanted to go other places, do other things, or die prematurely. That's why we invented CLONING, to bring back our pets whenever we miss them. Science! Solving problems, every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/305640/extras/71a9d48b431057fa2d222e7e37955cec.avif?t=1764602480\" width=615 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plus</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely Procedurally Generated Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone gets the same Daily Challenge - compare your progress with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class system - each clone skin has a different advantage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you survive or die, you'll come away better than you started!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/305640/extras/a6f8e3f8bd22291912a0c01fcd022c7b.poster.avif?t=1764602480\" width=616 height=375 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/305640/extras/a6f8e3f8bd22291912a0c01fcd022c7b.webm?t=1764602480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Farewell Clone001","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"Laws of Gravity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"Now Dasher, Now Dancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"From Orbit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"Exothermic Reaction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"Heart of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"Dissolved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"Frozen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/e784d78448ffa0e3d4353c4ff387d0e65c767a70.jpg"},{"name":"Bone Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/5b3a18c885f583e49f4d066f21a1e5aff2124452.jpg"},{"name":"Forgotten Labs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/305640/5b3a18c885f583e49f4d066f21a1e5aff2124452.jpg"}],"total":70},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/305640?t=1764602480","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/305640/fb14cafadbefc0ada1d6b8663be17eb16eb3a388/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764602480","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/305640/f6f71f35b1d937dc1213a7576fd5542184d59121/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764602480","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/305640/f6f71f35b1d937dc1213a7576fd5542184d59121/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764602480","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous planet that's different every time and try to survive! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Union's job for you is clear: research the alien wildlife -- for science! However, in this case, researching may include lasers, explosions, hungry aliens, space sushi, and other similarly delicious-or-terrifying hazards. In-between missions, use scrap metal you've collected to upgrade your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >